  "ruleText": "Fors 401.02 Renewal Processing. Renewals shall be processed in accordance with Plc 308.09 through Plc 308.12.\n\nSource. #5222, eff 9-11-91; EXPIRED 9-11-97\n\nNew. #6597, INTERIM, eff 10-8-97, EXPIRED: 2-5-98\n\nNew. #6876, eff 10-28-98; ss by #8710, eff 8-25-06; ss by #10087, eff 3-1-12; ss by #10544, eff 3-13-14; ss by #14086, eff 11-24-24",
